cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "php2shell-hunt - local-lab PHP vulnerability research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Popa
    given-names: Andrei
    affiliation: PaxDynamics
repository-code: "https://github.com/ikow/php2shell-hunt"
url: "https://github.com/ikow/php2shell-hunt"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-31"
abstract: >-
  php2shell-hunt is a local-lab research repository for PHP core and
  application vulnerability research. It uses a verification-first pipeline
  in which every claim is backed by a loopback lab run and controls, with
  static analysis serving only as candidate generation. Findings are labelled
  STOCK, CONFIG-GATED, or LAB-ONLY so readers can distinguish default-build
  impact from configuration-dependent or lab-only results.
keywords:
  - php
  - vulnerability-research
  - exploitation
  - memory-safety
  - security
